1x1 controller 19 (DE5 - QMD Adaptive Control GUI)

this next version extends the **DE5/QMD Adaptive Control GUI** to include
✅ **Profile save/load** for PI tuning presets (e.g., “Eco”, “Aggressive”, “Balanced”)
✅ Simple local JSON storage for persistence between runs
✅ Drop-down selector and Save/Load buttons tied into the live UART updates

